    "description": "Basically, obviously, musically… ipudu manam sankalu gudeskoni ‘Happy Independence Day’ chepeskuntam. Exact ga ela untundhi ante prethi year Gemini TV lo Khadgam cinema osthundhi, alage prethi year Independence day osthundhi, anthe. Pedhaga manalo manaki maarpu matram desam meedha radhu, raledhu, neelo oka bhoku gadu ranivvadu. ⁣\n⁣\nMana daridrapu society lo ‘Desam meedha goosebumps kante, putina roju ki birthday bumps ae yekuva’. ⁣\n⁣\nRape lu, suicide lu, caste godavalu jarigina next second prethi bokesh na koduku kotte first dialouge ‘India inthe ra’. Mari nuvu ochi marcha radhu? Sollu sollu yedava sollu.. ⁣\n⁣\nAsalu ‘India inthe ra’ - ane sagham mandhi lo, vote hakku undi, vote veyakunda, snapchat lo snap lu pampichukune rakhalu. Adhe bigg boss lo votelu muddi lepakunda veyamante yesthav kani, polling booth ki pora ante adhi yedho boothu la chusthav. Nuvu malli dialouge lu kotatam, chuttu unde valla chapatlu kotadam. Bose dk kathalu.⁣\n⁣\nChinnapilalki school lo Gandhi garu gurinchi em nerpisthunaro telidhu kani, manalanti yedavalu matram, ‘Aayinaki idharu’ ane jokelu nerpisthunam. Neyeba, mari yevado techina freedom manaki endhuku ra? Sachiporadhu?⁣\n⁣\nPondicherry lo, Goa lo mandhu thakuva lo dorukuthundhi ana prethi sari, manaki freedom rakapoyi unte mandhu cheap ga dorikedhi ani sollu matalu chepukune vallu bochudu mandhi unaru. Meeru antha papikonda lo unde konda papulu, ramayanam lo lankhini yeshalu yeskoni brathikeyandi. ⁣\n⁣\nMana mentality entha worst ante, nuvu utcha aapukolev, kani nee intiki pakana yevado utcha posthe matram thatukolev. ‘India maradhu, veelu mararu’ antav. Mari nuvu chesedhi endhi samsarama?⁣\n⁣\nKotha road ratri yesithe, podhugale yedho delivery cheyalsina doctor la dhani meedha nunchi yelipothav, malla varsha kalam lo ‘pani vadu pandhiri yesthe, pichukalu padagotnai anta’ antav. Inkenni rojulu thamudu ilane gadipestham? ⁣\n⁣\nInka ee road ki meedha nela thalliki panparak chukkalu ankitham chese batch untundhi, nuvu oonchina prethisari, roadu reverse lo nee mokam meedha oonchali ani manasupurthi ga korukuntuna. Alanti technology kanipedthe baunu, vallaki nenu digital media branding free ga chesi pedtha. *Continuation in comment section*",
